<script src="<%=url_for(helperGetFileVersion('/bobo-js/include/widgets/scripta.js'))%>" type="text/javascript"></script>

<div class="card">
    <!-- <div class="preloader-mini" id="preloader-scripta">
        <span class="fa-stack fa-4x">
            <i class="fa-thin fa-bahai fa-stack-2x fa-flip text-warning"  style="--fa-animation-duration: 2s; opacity: 0.9; text-shadow: 2px 2px 3px #ddd;"></i>
            <i class="fa-duotone fa-mug-hot fa-stack-1x fa-beat" style="font-size: 0.7em; line-height: 2.6em; --fa-flip-x: 0; --fa-secondary-opacity: 1.0; --fa-primary-color: #2293b5; --fa-secondary-color: #dc5a08; text-shadow: 2px 2px 3px #cacaca;"></i>
        </span>
    </div> -->
    <div class="card-body" id="widget-scripta">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-sm-12">
                <h4 class="card-title">Import dati laboratorio ARPA VDA</h4>
                <h6 class="card-subtitle">Lancia manualmente la procedura <code>"SCRIPTA"</code> e <strong>importa in OPAS</strong> i dati del laboratorio</h6>
                <hr class="hp-dotted" />
                <p class="m-t-15">Esegui il programma di importazione dei <strong>dati di laboratorio ARPA VDA</strong>, situato sul server "SCRIPT" di Liguria Digitale, al percorso <code class="text-gray-dark highlight">/home/opas/bin/arpa_vda/scripta/scripta_import.sh</code> Il programma <strong>preleva automaticamente i dati dal server FTP di ARPA</strong>, accessibile all'indirizzo <code class="text-gray-dark highlight">remotedisk.hextra.it</code></p>
                <p><a href="#" class="btn btn-info btn-rounded" id="scripta-run"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-play"></i> Esegui "SCRIPTA"</a></p>
                <p><textarea class="form-control" rows="13" id="scripta-log" name="scripta-log"></textarea></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <%
        foreach my $row ( @{$options} ) {
            foreach my $widget ( @{$row} ){
                if($widget->{'wdg_page_html'} eq '/scripta'){

                    my $dest = $widget->{'gw_dest'};
                    if( $dest->{'type'} eq 'page' || $dest->{'type'} eq 'external' ){
    %>
                    <div class="card-footer">
                        <span class="show-more">
                            <a href="<%= $dest->{'link'} %>" class="show-more"><i class="mdi mdi-library-plus"></i> <%= $dest->{'title'} %> &raquo;</a>
                        </span>
                    </div>
    <%
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    %>
</div>